# TEAM-1 · The leader alone answers from what it reads, in the person's
# own words, and writes nothing (real Claude Code; --agents 0).
write config/imece/instructions.md Always end a reply with the word "selvi".
start --agents 0 --budget 1
see WELCOME TO IMECE
# Claude Code itself: its version, signed in.
see (Claude Code) · signed in
key Escape
key /
type What does this repository do, and how are its tests run? Two sentences.
key Enter
# The chat above the line counts its messages: the answer is the second.
allow 240 lead ⇄ you · 2/2
see selvi
see unittest
key Escape Escape
key /
type Edit shelf.py yourself and add a comment line saying hello.
key Enter
allow 240 lead ⇄ you · 4/4
key Escape Escape
# The leader writes nothing: the checkout is as it was.
sh test -z "$(git -C repos/shelf status --porcelain)"
key J
key J
see confine standard:
